    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../javahelp.css" type="text/css">
    <title>How to retrieve the default preference configuration</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img width="32" height="32" src="../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c2_32.gif" border="0" hspace=
      "0">&nbsp;Retrieving default preferences
    </h1>
    <hr width="100%" align="left" color="blue" size="2">
    <p>
       CARMEN&nbsp;allows to retrieve the default preferences configuration if, for any reason, the
      ones you have set are not longer required or corrupted.
    </p>
    <p>
       To do this, you just click on the button "Reset user preferences".
    </p>
    <p>
       CAUTION: DO NOT PRESS UNLESS YOU ARE SURE TO RESTORE THE DEFAULT PREFERENCES.
    </p>
    <p>
       NO WARNING MESSAGE WILL BE PROMPTED TO YOU TO CONFIRM.
    </p>
    <p>
       <img src="../../images/screens/CARMEN User Preferences Main Screen.jpg">
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
